{"id":"01d99918d9c17aa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-prop-elementary.md","title":"Elementary Properties","display":"prop-elementary — Elementary Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-elementary","aliases":["58-prop-elementary"],"display":"prop-elementary — Elementary Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[58-thm-tarski-vaught]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-elementary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-elementary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-elementary — Elementary Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"58-df-elementary-substructure\">58-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ff820d88f79bf52c\" href=\"?note=ff820d88f79bf52c\" title=\"58-thm-tarski-vaught\">58-thm-tarski-vaught</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span> are structures in the same first-order language</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\">\\(\\prec_L\\)</span> is the exact elementary-substructure alias</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S\\)</span> is the assignment-based witness predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff820d88f79bf52c\" href=\"?note=ff820d88f79bf52c\" title=\"58-thm-tarski-vaught\">58-thm-tarski-vaught</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A\\prec_L\\mathcal B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A\\prec_L\\mathcal B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility proposition reuses the fully typed Tarski--Vaught criterion instead of duplicating a second bare-satisfaction formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-tarski-vaught","status":"resolved","id":"ff820d88f79bf52c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-tarski-vaught]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-tarski-vaught","status":"resolved","id":"ff820d88f79bf52c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S$ is the assignment-based witness predicate from [[58-thm-tarski-vaught]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A\\prec_L\\mathcal B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TarskiVaughtCriterion}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,L).","display":true}],"bytes":880,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-